2da6b947 (307 1793315828082 "guenchi" (("1lwdlzul" . 1) ("o01rj2kt" . 9352)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing r1") (src . "gfx: a sweep starting on a capsule's axis has nothing to enter\n\nobstacle-sweep reports only contacts entering along the normal, and a\ncapsule's normal is the direction from the nearest point on its axis\nsegment to the contact.  A query starting on that segment has no such\ndirection; the reverse of the motion stood in for it, and the entering\ntest always accepted that, so a sphere starting at a pillar's centre, or\nat a ball's, reported a blocker at fraction zero whichever way it moved.\nSuch a start now gives no hit from that obstacle.\n\nOnly an exact zero counts, judged on the largest component rather than\non the squared length, which underflows long before the vector is zero;\nevery other start, however near the axis, is judged by its real\ndirection, and a very short direction is scaled before it is normalized\nso the normal still has length one.  The fallback used to cover every\nstart within about 3.2e-5 of the axis.  Ordinary contacts keep their\nnormals to the last bit.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 785))))
